      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is growing evidence that improvement of endothelial function has the potential to reduce cardiovascular ris. This article reviews the impact of coronary risk factors on endothelial function and the benefits of risk factor reduction. Recent studies indicate that chronic exercise may directly improve endothelial function, thus providing an additional explanation for the benefits of increased physical activity."},
